{"repositoryId":1316577053,"availability":"available","full":"eakbulut/foley","name":"foley","description":"Sound effects for the interface, performed live. 28 Web Audio cues, zero dependencies.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":108,"forks":2,"created":"2026-07-29T21:22:14Z","updated":"2026-09-16T15:59:09Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://usefoley.dev","topics":["javascript","microinteractions","sound-effects","ui-sounds","web-audio"],"demo":"https://usefoley.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.077Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.077Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.077Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:11.077Z","stars":108,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sound effects for the interface, performed live. Play the demo →","Foley is a tiny, dependency-free library of 28 interaction sounds, named for the film artists who perform footsteps and door-latches in sync with the picture. It does the same for your interface: every cue is synthesized with Web Audio at the instant of the action. No audio files, no network requests, no build step.","Sibling to Dolly (repo), which does scroll-driven motion the same way — one attribute, no JavaScript."],"features":["28 cues in 7 families — pointer, press, toggle, feedback, notify, motion, state","4 themes — default, soft, mechanical, glass — or your own transform, or a full sound set","Cues are data — edit any cue's layers with getSpec()/playSpec(), or visually in the Cue Designer","7.6 kB minified + gzipped for the whole API — 5.9 kB for the usual bind + play + set, since it tree-shakes; zero dependencies, one ES module","Placed in space — pan or 3D pos per play, or set({ localize }) to pan every bound cue to where its element sits on screen"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/eakbulut/foley/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b807030390ee26f0b492e02e1e23de292316b8edaab9a57e52391040dc1338eb",